{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_c457d4b7fee340b58945616e","type":"tool_result","content":"100\t    ↓\n101\t02:00 危险时段 → 强制留守，事件密集期（生存/调查/决策）\n102\t    ↓\n103\t05:00 黎明 → 事件消退，结算今日收入/生存状态\n104\t    ↓\n105\t06:00 新一天 → 难度升级 + 新事件解锁 + 剧情推进\n106\t```\n107\t\n108\t### 4.2 详细流程\n109\t\n110\t#### 白天经营（06:00–22:00）\n111\t\n112\t1. **进货系统**：从供应商目录选择商品，控制成本\n113\t2. **定价策略**：根据客流和需求调整售价（太高卖不动，太低亏本）\n114\t3. **货架管理**：把商品摆上货架，保持整洁度评分\n115\t4. **顾客服务**：收银、找零、处理投诉（正常的便利店经营）\n116\t5. **店铺升级**：用赚的钱购买设备、装修、安全措施\n117\t\n118\t**玩家体验目标**：白天的经营是\"安全感\"，也是建立对环境熟悉度的过程。越熟悉白天的一切，夜晚的异常就越令人不安。\n119\t\n120\t#### 深夜经营（22:00–02:00）\n121\t\n122\t1. 顾客变少，但开始出现\"不正常的顾客\"\n123\t2. 环境开始微妙变化（灯闪烁、货架轻微移动、收银机异响）\n124\t3. 玩家可选择继续营业（更多收入 + 更多风险）或提前关门（安全但少赚钱）\n125\t4. 触发轻度异常事件（见异常事件表）\n126\t\n127\t#### 危险时段（02:00–05:00）\n128\t\n129\t1. 不能离开店铺（合同约束 → 游戏机制）\n130\t2. 事件密度和强度大幅提升\n131\t3. 玩家需要在店内活动（巡逻、检查、应对事件）\n132\t4. 核心决策：躲藏 vs 调查 vs 对抗\n133\t5. 不同选择影响剧情走向和结局\n134\t\n135\t**玩家体验目标**：从\"掌控一切的店长\"到\"被困在店里的猎物\"，身份的转变是核心恐惧来源。\n136\t\n137\t### 4.3 元循环（跨天进度）\n138\t\n139\t```\n140\tDay N 的表现 → 影响 Day N+1 的:\n141\t  - 经营收入 → 可购买的安全措施/升级\n142\t  - 事件应对 → 影响\"他\"的好感度/敌意\n143\t  - 调查进度 → 解锁新区域/剧情线索\n144\t  - 生存状态 → 消耗品的存量（电池、药品等）\n145\t```\n146\t\n147\t---\n148\t\n149\t## 五、经营系统\n150\t\n151\t### 5.1 商品管理\n152\t\n153\t#### 商品分类\n154\t\n155\t| 类别 | 商品数 | 进货成本 | 售价范围 | 保质期 | 货架占用 |\n156\t|------|--------|---------|---------|--------|---------|\n157\t| 饮料 | 8 | ¥1-3 | ¥3-6 | 无 | 1 格 |\n158\t| 零食 | 10 | ¥0.5-2 | ¥2-5 | 7-30 天 | 1 格 |\n159\t| 便当 | 4 | ¥5-8 | ¥12-18 | 1-2 天 | 2 格 |\n160\t| 日用品 | 6 | ¥2-10 | ¥5-20 | 无 | 1 格 |\n161\t| **特殊商品** | 3+ | ¥? | ¥? | ? | ? |\n162\t\n163\t**特殊商品**：某些夜晚后，进货目录中会出现\"不应该存在的商品\"。购买并出售这些商品是推进剧情的关键，但也增加危险。\n164\t\n165\t#### 供应商系统\n166\t\n167\t| 供应商 | 特点 | 解锁 |\n168\t|--------|------|------|\n169\t| **正规批发** | 标准价格，稳定供货 | 初始 |\n170\t| **特价渠道** | 便宜 30%，但偶尔少货/错货 | Day 3 |\n171\t| **匿名供货** | 深夜才出现的供应商，货物诡异但利润极高 | Day 7 |\n172\t| **前任店员的线索** | 不是供应商，但能找到仓库里的\"特殊库存\" | Day 10 |\n173\t\n174\t### 5.2 顾客系统\n175\t\n176\t| 顾客类型 | 出现时间 | 消费特征 | 特殊行为 |\n177\t|----------|---------|---------|---------|\n178\t| 早高峰上班族 | 7:00-9:00 | 买饮料+早餐，速度快 | 无 |\n179\t| 午休白领 | 11:30-13:00 | 买便当，价格不敏感 | 无 |\n180\t| 学生 | 15:00-18:00 | 买零食，价格敏感 | 偶尔偷东西 |\n181\t| 晚间居民 | 18:00-21:00 | 买日用品，消费稳定 | 会闲聊（提供线索） |\n182\t| **深夜顾客** | 23:00-2:00 | 消费额高，但... | 外形/行为逐步异常 |\n183\t\n184\t### 5.3 收入与经济\n185\t\n186\t| 指标 | 数值 |\n187\t|------|------|\n188\t| 日均正常收入 | ¥200-500（取决于经营水平） |\n189\t| 每日固定支出 | 房租¥100 + 电费¥20 |\n190\t| 债务目标 | 30 天内还清 ¥300,000（看似不可能） |\n191\t| **特殊收入** | 出售异常商品可获得 ¥500-5000/次，但伴随风险 |\n192\t\n193\t经济压力设计：正常经营不可能还清债务，迫使玩家与\"异常\"互动。\n194\t\n195\t### 5.4 店铺升级\n196\t\n197\t| 升级 | 成本 | 效果 | 恐怖关联 |\n198\t|------|------|------|---------|\n199\t| 监控摄像头 ×4 | ¥2,000 | 实时查看店内各区域 | 夜晚录像中可能看到不该看到的东西 |\n200\t| 更亮的灯 | ¥500 | 店内照明+50% | 暗角减少，但某些东西在亮处更清楚 |\n201\t| 防盗门 | ¥3,000 | 后门加固 | 减少物理入侵事件，但也减少了逃跑路线 |\n202\t| 收银机升级 | ¥1,000 | 交易速度+30% | 异常收银记录更精确（好事还是坏事？） |\n203\t| 仓库货架 | ¥800 | 库存+50% | 仓库更深更暗... |\n204\t| 紧急按钮 | ¥5,000 | 按下后... | 会有人来吗？ |\n205\t| 收音机 | ¥300 | 可以放音乐/听广播 | 深夜广播内容是重要线索源 |\n206\t| 手电筒 | ¥200 | 照亮暗角 | 电池消耗品，黑暗中唯一可靠的光 |\n207\t\n208\t---\n209\t\n210\t## 六、恐怖系统\n211\t\n212\t### 6.1 设计原则\n213\t\n214\t| 原则 | 说明 |\n215\t|------|------|\n216\t| **期待 > 展示** | 让玩家自己脑补比直接展示更恐怖。\"你感觉有什么东西在身后\"比放一个怪物模型更有效 |\n217\t| **安全感建立 → 安全感剥夺** | 先让玩家觉得\"我熟悉这个地方\"，然后打破熟悉感 |\n218\t| **不可预测性** | 事件触发有随机性，玩家无法完全记住模式 |\n219\t| **可控的恐惧** | 提供应对手段（躲藏、光源、关门），让玩家有能动性而非无助 |\n220\t| **主播反应设计** | 每个事件至少有一个\"让主播尖叫\"的瞬间 — 突然的声响、突然的视觉变化、突然的NPC行为 |\n221\t\n222\t### 6.2 异常事件分类\n223\t\n224\t#### Level 1：环境异常（微恐，Day 1-5）\n225\t\n226\t| 事件 ID | 事件名 | 触发概率 | 表现 | 主播反应点 |\n227\t|---------|--------|---------|------|-----------|\n228\t| E-101 | 商品位移 | 15% | 某个货架上的商品在你不注意时换了位置 | \"等等...这个不应该是这边的吗？\" |\n229\t| E-102 | 收银机异常 | 10% | 收银机自动打开/关上，或显示异常金额 | 突然的机械声 |\n230\t| E-103 | 灯光闪烁 | 20% | 某盏灯间歇性闪烁，频率逐渐加快 | 闪烁突然停止时比闪烁更恐怖 |\n231\t| E-104 | 温度骤降 | 12% | 画面边缘出现霜冻效果，呼吸可见 | 纯视觉效果+风声 |\n232\t| E-105 | 镜子反射 | 8% | 监控画面中偶尔闪过一个人影（不是你） | \"那个人是谁？？\" |\n233\t| E-106 | 电话响铃 | 5% | 店里的座机响起，接听后只有白噪音或低语 | 铃声本身+接听后的失望 |\n234\t| E-107 | 冰箱异响 | 15% | 冰箱突然发出很大的嗡鸣，然后瞬间安静 | 巨大的对比 |\n235\t\n236\t#### Level 2：实体异常（中恐，Day 6-15）\n237\t\n238\t| 事件 ID | 事件名 | 触发概率 | 表现 | 主播反应点 |\n239\t|---------|--------|---------|------|-----------|\n240\t| E-201 | 异常顾客 | 25% | 深夜来了一位\"顾客\"，外形逐渐不正常（脸模糊/动作僵硬/不说话） | 顾客突然转头直视玩家 |\n241\t| E-202 | 影子错位 | 18% | 你的影子在灯光下角度不对，或者有自己的动作 | 影子突然停止但你还在动 |\n242\t| E-203 | 仓库声响 | 20% | 仓库传来搬东西的声音，但检查时无人 | 打开仓库门瞬间的寂静 |\n243\t| E-204 | 外面的脚步 | 22% | 门外有脚步声来回走动，但监控看不到人 | 脚步声停在门口 |\n244\t| E-205 | 新商品 | 10% | 货架上出现了你没进过货的商品，包装上的文字无法辨认 | 拿起商品时的描述文本 |\n245\t| E-206 | 收银记录 | 15% | 收银机打印出一张不属于今天的收据，时间是一个月前 | 收据上的信息是剧情线索 |\n246\t\n247\t#### Level 3：直接威胁（高恐，Day 16-25）\n248\t\n249\t| 事件 ID | 事件名 | 触发概率 | 表现 | 主播反应点 |\n250\t|---------|--------|---------|------|-----------|\n251\t| E-301 | 尾随者 | 20% | 后巷监控中出现一个身影，每次检查都更近 | 某次查看监控时身影就在镜头前 |\n252\t| E-302 | 闭路电视 | 15% | 监控画面切换到店内另一个角度——画面里有\"你\"，但你不在那个位置 | \"那不是我\" |\n253\t| E-303 | 门自动开 | 18% | 前门或后门自己打开，风吹进来，收银机的钱飞散 | 门开后外面是完全的黑暗 |\n254\t| E-304 | 走廊延伸 | 12% | 通往仓库的走廊看起来比平时更长，灯光变暗 | 走到尽头发现多了一扇门 |\n255\t| E-305 | 音频入侵 | 10% | 收音机突然播放不属于正常频道的内容（前任店员的声音） | \"他就在我旁边\" |\n256\t\n257\t#### Level 4：存在性威胁（极高恐，Day 26-30）\n258\t\n259\t| 事件 ID | 事件名 | 触发概率 | 表现 | 主播反应点 |\n260\t|---------|--------|---------|------|-----------|\n261\t| E-401 | 平行店 | 8% | 某些条件满足后，进入镜像便利店 — 一切左右翻转 | 你在对面看到了\"自己\" |\n262\t| E-402 | 时间循环 | 10% | 时钟突然倒转，你重复经历同一天（但异常在累积） | 意识到\"又是今天\" |\n263\t| E-403 | \"他\"来了 | 5% | \"他\"真正出现 — 不是Jump Scare，而是缓慢的、不可阻挡的接近 | 持续30秒的紧张逼近，无处可藏 |\n264\t| E-404 | 店铺异变 | 12% | 店铺结构开始改变（墙壁移动、新增房间、消失的门） | 你曾经熟悉的布局变得陌生 |\n265\t| E-405 | 终局选择 | 剧情触发 | 基于之前所有选择，面临最终决定 | 揭示一切真相的时刻 |\n266\t\n267\t### 6.3 Jump Scare 设计原则\n268\t\n269\t| 原则 | 说明 | 反例（禁止） |\n270\t|------|------|------------|\n271\t| **有意义** | Jump Scare 必须服务于叙事，不是随机惊吓 | 无缘无故的鬼脸弹窗 |\n272\t| **有预警** | 给玩家 1-3 秒的\"不对劲\"预兆，让他们知道要来了但不知道具体什么时候 | 零预兆突然爆炸声 |\n273\t| **有后果** | Jump Scare 之后有游戏机制影响（消耗品减少、收入损失等） | 吓完就什么都没了 |\n274\t| **有限频次** | 单个游戏日内最多 2 次经典 Jump Scare，其余用氛围恐怖 | 每5分钟一次Jump Scare |\n275\t| **有变化** | 同一类型事件每次触发的具体表现有随机变化 | 每次都是一样的动画 |\n276\t\n277\t### 6.4 恐惧调节系统\n278\t\n279\t为防止玩家恐惧疲劳（过度恐惧→放弃游戏），设计恐惧调节：\n280\t\n281\t| 机制 | 规则 |\n282\t|------|------|\n283\t| 连续高恐事件后 | 下一个事件降级（Level 3→Level 1） |\n284\t| 玩家连续躲藏/回避 | 事件频率降低，给恢复时间 |\n285\t| 白天经营阶段 | 绝对安全，恐惧值为 0 |\n286\t| 设置选项 | 恐惧强度可调（高/中/低），影响事件频率和 Jump Scare 触发 |\n287\t\n288\t---\n289\t\n290\t## 七、叙事框架\n291\t\n292\t### 7.1 故事结构\n293\t\n294\t采用\"洋葱式\"叙事——每一层真相揭开后又暴露出更深层的谜团。\n295\t\n296\t| 层级 | 解锁时机 | 揭示内容 |\n297\t|------|---------|---------|\n298\t| **表层** | Day 1-5 | 这家便利店有点奇怪，前任店员失联了 |\n299\t| **第一层** | Day 6-10 | 前任店员留下了笔记，他发现了\"规律\" |"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d0384c8e-0462-4f8e-9470-2647774e089a","uuid":"0d3c874c-8dbf-4fde-a1f8-f173528fb40d","timestamp":"2026-05-23T05:12:29.847Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"D:\\game-projects\\steam-horror-sim\\GDD.md","content":"    ↓\n02:00 危险时段 → 强制留守，事件密集期（生存/调查/决策）\n    ↓\n05:00 黎明 → 事件消退，结算今日收入/生存状态\n    ↓\n06:00 新一天 → 难度升级 + 新事件解锁 + 剧情推进\n```\n\n### 4.2 详细流程\n\n#### 白天经营（06:00–22:00）\n\n1. **进货系统**：从供应商目录选择商品，控制成本\n2. **定价策略**：根据客流和需求调整售价（太高卖不动，太低亏本）\n3. **货架管理**：把商品摆上货架，保持整洁度评分\n4. **顾客服务**：收银、找零、处理投诉（正常的便利店经营）\n5. **店铺升级**：用赚的钱购买设备、装修、安全措施\n\n**玩家体验目标**：白天的经营是\"安全感\"，也是建立对环境熟悉度的过程。越熟悉白天的一切，夜晚的异常就越令人不安。\n\n#### 深夜经营（22:00–02:00）\n\n1. 顾客变少，但开始出现\"不正常的顾客\"\n2. 环境开始微妙变化（灯闪烁、货架轻微移动、收银机异响）\n3. 玩家可选择继续营业（更多收入 + 更多风险）或提前关门（安全但少赚钱）\n4. 触发轻度异常事件（见异常事件表）\n\n#### 危险时段（02:00–05:00）\n\n1. 不能离开店铺（合同约束 → 游戏机制）\n2. 事件密度和强度大幅提升\n3. 玩家需要在店内活动（巡逻、检查、应对事件）\n4. 核心决策：躲藏 vs 调查 vs 对抗\n5. 不同选择影响剧情走向和结局\n\n**玩家体验目标**：从\"掌控一切的店长\"到\"被困在店里的猎物\"，身份的转变是核心恐惧来源。\n\n### 4.3 元循环（跨天进度）\n\n```\nDay N 的表现 → 影响 Day N+1 的:\n  - 经营收入 → 可购买的安全措施/升级\n  - 事件应对 → 影响\"他\"的好感度/敌意\n  - 调查进度 → 解锁新区域/剧情线索\n  - 生存状态 → 消耗品的存量（电池、药品等）\n```\n\n---\n\n## 五、经营系统\n\n### 5.1 商品管理\n\n#### 商品分类\n\n| 类别 | 商品数 | 进货成本 | 售价范围 | 保质期 | 货架占用 |\n|------|--------|---------|---------|--------|---------|\n| 饮料 | 8 | ¥1-3 | ¥3-6 | 无 | 1 格 |\n| 零食 | 10 | ¥0.5-2 | ¥2-5 | 7-30 天 | 1 格 |\n| 便当 | 4 | ¥5-8 | ¥12-18 | 1-2 天 | 2 格 |\n| 日用品 | 6 | ¥2-10 | ¥5-20 | 无 | 1 格 |\n| **特殊商品** | 3+ | ¥? | ¥? | ? | ? |\n\n**特殊商品**：某些夜晚后，进货目录中会出现\"不应该存在的商品\"。购买并出售这些商品是推进剧情的关键，但也增加危险。\n\n#### 供应商系统\n\n| 供应商 | 特点 | 解锁 |\n|--------|------|------|\n| **正规批发** | 标准价格，稳定供货 | 初始 |\n| **特价渠道** | 便宜 30%，但偶尔少货/错货 | Day 3 |\n| **匿名供货** | 深夜才出现的供应商，货物诡异但利润极高 | Day 7 |\n| **前任店员的线索** | 不是供应商，但能找到仓库里的\"特殊库存\" | Day 10 |\n\n### 5.2 顾客系统\n\n| 顾客类型 | 出现时间 | 消费特征 | 特殊行为 |\n|----------|---------|---------|---------|\n| 早高峰上班族 | 7:00-9:00 | 买饮料+早餐，速度快 | 无 |\n| 午休白领 | 11:30-13:00 | 买便当，价格不敏感 | 无 |\n| 学生 | 15:00-18:00 | 买零食，价格敏感 | 偶尔偷东西 |\n| 晚间居民 | 18:00-21:00 | 买日用品，消费稳定 | 会闲聊（提供线索） |\n| **深夜顾客** | 23:00-2:00 | 消费额高，但... | 外形/行为逐步异常 |\n\n### 5.3 收入与经济\n\n| 指标 | 数值 |\n|------|------|\n| 日均正常收入 | ¥200-500（取决于经营水平） |\n| 每日固定支出 | 房租¥100 + 电费¥20 |\n| 债务目标 | 30 天内还清 ¥300,000（看似不可能） |\n| **特殊收入** | 出售异常商品可获得 ¥500-5000/次，但伴随风险 |\n\n经济压力设计：正常经营不可能还清债务，迫使玩家与\"异常\"互动。\n\n### 5.4 店铺升级\n\n| 升级 | 成本 | 效果 | 恐怖关联 |\n|------|------|------|---------|\n| 监控摄像头 ×4 | ¥2,000 | 实时查看店内各区域 | 夜晚录像中可能看到不该看到的东西 |\n| 更亮的灯 | ¥500 | 店内照明+50% | 暗角减少，但某些东西在亮处更清楚 |\n| 防盗门 | ¥3,000 | 后门加固 | 减少物理入侵事件，但也减少了逃跑路线 |\n| 收银机升级 | ¥1,000 | 交易速度+30% | 异常收银记录更精确（好事还是坏事？） |\n| 仓库货架 | ¥800 | 库存+50% | 仓库更深更暗... |\n| 紧急按钮 | ¥5,000 | 按下后... | 会有人来吗？ |\n| 收音机 | ¥300 | 可以放音乐/听广播 | 深夜广播内容是重要线索源 |\n| 手电筒 | ¥200 | 照亮暗角 | 电池消耗品，黑暗中唯一可靠的光 |\n\n---\n\n## 六、恐怖系统\n\n### 6.1 设计原则\n\n| 原则 | 说明 |\n|------|------|\n| **期待 > 展示** | 让玩家自己脑补比直接展示更恐怖。\"你感觉有什么东西在身后\"比放一个怪物模型更有效 |\n| **安全感建立 → 安全感剥夺** | 先让玩家觉得\"我熟悉这个地方\"，然后打破熟悉感 |\n| **不可预测性** | 事件触发有随机性，玩家无法完全记住模式 |\n| **可控的恐惧** | 提供应对手段（躲藏、光源、关门），让玩家有能动性而非无助 |\n| **主播反应设计** | 每个事件至少有一个\"让主播尖叫\"的瞬间 — 突然的声响、突然的视觉变化、突然的NPC行为 |\n\n### 6.2 异常事件分类\n\n#### Level 1：环境异常（微恐，Day 1-5）\n\n| 事件 ID | 事件名 | 触发概率 | 表现 | 主播反应点 |\n|---------|--------|---------|------|-----------|\n| E-101 | 商品位移 | 15% | 某个货架上的商品在你不注意时换了位置 | \"等等...这个不应该是这边的吗？\" |\n| E-102 | 收银机异常 | 10% | 收银机自动打开/关上，或显示异常金额 | 突然的机械声 |\n| E-103 | 灯光闪烁 | 20% | 某盏灯间歇性闪烁，频率逐渐加快 | 闪烁突然停止时比闪烁更恐怖 |\n| E-104 | 温度骤降 | 12% | 画面边缘出现霜冻效果，呼吸可见 | 纯视觉效果+风声 |\n| E-105 | 镜子反射 | 8% | 监控画面中偶尔闪过一个人影（不是你） | \"那个人是谁？？\" |\n| E-106 | 电话响铃 | 5% | 店里的座机响起，接听后只有白噪音或低语 | 铃声本身+接听后的失望 |\n| E-107 | 冰箱异响 | 15% | 冰箱突然发出很大的嗡鸣，然后瞬间安静 | 巨大的对比 |\n\n#### Level 2：实体异常（中恐，Day 6-15）\n\n| 事件 ID | 事件名 | 触发概率 | 表现 | 主播反应点 |\n|---------|--------|---------|------|-----------|\n| E-201 | 异常顾客 | 25% | 深夜来了一位\"顾客\"，外形逐渐不正常（脸模糊/动作僵硬/不说话） | 顾客突然转头直视玩家 |\n| E-202 | 影子错位 | 18% | 你的影子在灯光下角度不对，或者有自己的动作 | 影子突然停止但你还在动 |\n| E-203 | 仓库声响 | 20% | 仓库传来搬东西的声音，但检查时无人 | 打开仓库门瞬间的寂静 |\n| E-204 | 外面的脚步 | 22% | 门外有脚步声来回走动，但监控看不到人 | 脚步声停在门口 |\n| E-205 | 新商品 | 10% | 货架上出现了你没进过货的商品，包装上的文字无法辨认 | 拿起商品时的描述文本 |\n| E-206 | 收银记录 | 15% | 收银机打印出一张不属于今天的收据，时间是一个月前 | 收据上的信息是剧情线索 |\n\n#### Level 3：直接威胁（高恐，Day 16-25）\n\n| 事件 ID | 事件名 | 触发概率 | 表现 | 主播反应点 |\n|---------|--------|---------|------|-----------|\n| E-301 | 尾随者 | 20% | 后巷监控中出现一个身影，每次检查都更近 | 某次查看监控时身影就在镜头前 |\n| E-302 | 闭路电视 | 15% | 监控画面切换到店内另一个角度——画面里有\"你\"，但你不在那个位置 | \"那不是我\" |\n| E-303 | 门自动开 | 18% | 前门或后门自己打开，风吹进来，收银机的钱飞散 | 门开后外面是完全的黑暗 |\n| E-304 | 走廊延伸 | 12% | 通往仓库的走廊看起来比平时更长，灯光变暗 | 走到尽头发现多了一扇门 |\n| E-305 | 音频入侵 | 10% | 收音机突然播放不属于正常频道的内容（前任店员的声音） | \"他就在我旁边\" |\n\n#### Level 4：存在性威胁（极高恐，Day 26-30）\n\n| 事件 ID | 事件名 | 触发概率 | 表现 | 主播反应点 |\n|---------|--------|---------|------|-----------|\n| E-401 | 平行店 | 8% | 某些条件满足后，进入镜像便利店 — 一切左右翻转 | 你在对面看到了\"自己\" |\n| E-402 | 时间循环 | 10% | 时钟突然倒转，你重复经历同一天（但异常在累积） | 意识到\"又是今天\" |\n| E-403 | \"他\"来了 | 5% | \"他\"真正出现 — 不是Jump Scare，而是缓慢的、不可阻挡的接近 | 持续30秒的紧张逼近，无处可藏 |\n| E-404 | 店铺异变 | 12% | 店铺结构开始改变（墙壁移动、新增房间、消失的门） | 你曾经熟悉的布局变得陌生 |\n| E-405 | 终局选择 | 剧情触发 | 基于之前所有选择，面临最终决定 | 揭示一切真相的时刻 |\n\n### 6.3 Jump Scare 设计原则\n\n| 原则 | 说明 | 反例（禁止） |\n|------|------|------------|\n| **有意义** | Jump Scare 必须服务于叙事，不是随机惊吓 | 无缘无故的鬼脸弹窗 |\n| **有预警** | 给玩家 1-3 秒的\"不对劲\"预兆，让他们知道要来了但不知道具体什么时候 | 零预兆突然爆炸声 |\n| **有后果** | Jump Scare 之后有游戏机制影响（消耗品减少、收入损失等） | 吓完就什么都没了 |\n| **有限频次** | 单个游戏日内最多 2 次经典 Jump Scare，其余用氛围恐怖 | 每5分钟一次Jump Scare |\n| **有变化** | 同一类型事件每次触发的具体表现有随机变化 | 每次都是一样的动画 |\n\n### 6.4 恐惧调节系统\n\n为防止玩家恐惧疲劳（过度恐惧→放弃游戏），设计恐惧调节：\n\n| 机制 | 规则 |\n|------|------|\n| 连续高恐事件后 | 下一个事件降级（Level 3→Level 1） |\n| 玩家连续躲藏/回避 | 事件频率降低，给恢复时间 |\n| 白天经营阶段 | 绝对安全，恐惧值为 0 |\n| 设置选项 | 恐惧强度可调（高/中/低），影响事件频率和 Jump Scare 触发 |\n\n---\n\n## 七、叙事框架\n\n### 7.1 故事结构\n\n采用\"洋葱式\"叙事——每一层真相揭开后又暴露出更深层的谜团。\n\n| 层级 | 解锁时机 | 揭示内容 |\n|------|---------|---------|\n| **表层** | Day 1-5 | 这家便利店有点奇怪，前任店员失联了 |\n| **第一层** | Day 6-10 | 前任店员留下了笔记，他发现了\"规律\" |","numLines":200,"startLine":100,"totalLines":745}}}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_a17811de84794b2a9cd99c14","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t// App.ts — Game main loop + state machine (v0.4.0 — M4: Horror Events)\n2\t\n3\timport { Renderer } from './Renderer';\n4\timport { StoreMap, TILE_SIZE, T } from '../game/StoreMap';\n5\timport { Player } from '../game/Player';\n6\timport {\n7\t  type GameState,\n8\t  type Interactable,\n9\t  type LightSource,\n10\t  GamePhase,\n11\t  UIPanel,\n12\t  createInitialState,\n13\t  loadGame,\n14\t  saveGame,\n15\t  startAutoSave,\n16\t  stopAutoSave,\n17\t  getPhaseFromTime,\n18\t  cloneState,\n19\t  isNightTime,\n20\t} from '../game/GameState';\n21\timport { ProductManager } from '../game/ProductManager';\n22\timport { CustomerManager } from '../game/CustomerManager';\n23\timport { CashRegister } from '../game/CashRegister';\n24\timport { PricingSystem } from '../game/PricingSystem';\n25\timport { EconomySystem } from '../game/EconomySystem';\n26\timport { ShelfInteraction, ShelfAction } from '../game/ShelfInteraction';\n27\timport { Customer, CustomerState } from '../game/Customer';\n28\timport { DayCycle } from '../game/DayCycle';\n29\timport { DaySummaryManager } from '../game/DaySummary';\n30\timport { UpgradeManager } from '../game/UpgradeManager';\n31\timport { SaveManager } from '../game/SaveManager';\n32\timport { HorrorEventManager, HorrorEventType } from '../game/HorrorEventManager';\n33\timport { AudioManager } from '../game/AudioManager';\n34\timport { NPCManager } from '../game/BehaviorTree';\n35\timport { JumpScareManager } from '../game/JumpScareManager';\n36\t\n37\texport class App {\n38\t  canvas: HTMLCanvasElement;\n39\t  renderer: Renderer;\n40\t  state: GameState;\n41\t  map: StoreMap;\n42\t  player: Player;\n43\t\n44\t  // M2 systems\n45\t  productManager: ProductManager;\n46\t  customerManager: CustomerManager;\n47\t  registers: CashRegister[];\n48\t  pricing: PricingSystem;\n49\t  economy: EconomySystem;\n50\t  shelfInteraction: ShelfInteraction;\n51\t\n52\t  // M3 systems\n53\t  dayCycle: DayCycle;\n54\t  daySummary: DaySummaryManager;\n55\t  upgradeManager: UpgradeManager;\n56\t  saveManager: SaveManager;\n57\t\n58\t  // M4 systems\n59\t  horrorManager: HorrorEventManager;\n60\t  audioManager: AudioManager;\n61\t\n62\t  // M5 systems\n63\t  npcManager: NPCManager;\n64\t  jumpScareManager: JumpScareManager;\n65\t\n66\t  private running = false;\n67\t  private lastFrameTime = 0;\n68\t  private animFrameId = 0;\n69\t  private activeCustomers: Customer[] = [];\n70\t  private lastTransactionNotification = '';\n71\t\n72\t  onStateChange?: (state: GameState) => void;\n73\t  onNotification?: (text: string) => void;\n74\t\n75\t  constructor(canvas: HTMLCanvasElement) {\n76\t    this.canvas = canvas;\n77\t    this.renderer = new Renderer(canvas);\n78\t\n79\t    const saved = loadGame();\n80\t    this.state = saved ? { ...createInitialState(), ...saved.gameState } : createInitialState();\n81\t\n82\t    this.map = new StoreMap();\n83\t    this.player = new Player(this.state.player);\n84\t    this.player.setupInput();\n85\t\n86\t    // Initialize M2 systems\n87\t    this.productManager = new ProductManager();\n88\t    this.customerManager = new CustomerManager();\n89\t    this.registers = [\n90\t      new CashRegister('register_1'),\n91\t      new CashRegister('register_2'),\n92\t    ];\n93\t    this.pricing = new PricingSystem(this.productManager);\n94\t    this.economy = new EconomySystem();\n95\t    this.shelfInteraction = new ShelfInteraction();\n96\t\n97\t    // Initialize M3 systems\n98\t    this.dayCycle = new DayCycle();\n99\t    this.daySummary = new DaySummaryManager();\n100\t    this.upgradeManager = new UpgradeManager();\n101\t    this.saveManager = new SaveManager();\n102\t\n103\t    // Initialize M4 systems\n104\t    this.horrorManager = new HorrorEventManager();\n105\t    this.audioManager = new AudioManager();\n106\t\n107\t    // Initialize M5 systems\n108\t    this.npcManager = new NPCManager();\n109\t    this.jumpScareManager = new JumpScareManager();\n110\t\n111\t    // Register systems with SaveManager\n112\t    this.saveManager.register('productManager', this.productManager);\n113\t    this.saveManager.register('economy', this.economy);\n114\t    this.saveManager.register('pricing', this.pricing);\n115\t    this.saveManager.register('customerManager', this.customerManager);\n116\t    this.saveManager.register('upgradeManager', this.upgradeManager);\n117\t    this.saveManager.register('daySummary', this.daySummary);\n118\t\n119\t    // Load save data for M2 systems\n120\t    if (saved) {\n121\t      if (saved.productManager && Object.keys(saved.productManager).length > 0) {\n122\t        this.productManager.loadSaveData(saved.productManager);\n123\t      }\n124\t      if (saved.economy && Object.keys(saved.economy).length > 0) {\n125\t        this.economy.loadSaveData(saved.economy);\n126\t      }\n127\t      if (saved.pricing && Object.keys(saved.pricing).length > 0) {\n128\t        this.pricing.loadSaveData(saved.pricing);\n129\t      }\n130\t      if (saved.customerStats && Object.keys(saved.customerStats).length > 0) {\n131\t        this.customerManager.loadSaveData(saved.customerStats);\n132\t      }\n133\t      if (saved.registers) {\n134\t        for (let i = 0; i < saved.registers.length && i < this.registers.length; i++) {\n135\t          this.registers[i].loadSaveData(saved.registers[i]);\n136\t        }\n137\t      }\n138\t\n139\t      // Restore M3 day cycle state\n140\t      this.dayCycle.setDay(this.state.day);\n141\t      this.dayCycle.setTimeOfDay(this.state.timeOfDay);\n142\t    }\n143\t\n144\t    // Apply purchased upgrades\n145\t    this.applyUpgrades();\n146\t\n147\t    // Setup interactable objects\n148\t    this.state.interactables = this.createInteractables();\n149\t    this.state.lights = this.createLights();\n150\t\n151\t    // Give some starting inventory\n152\t    if (!saved) {\n153\t      this.setupStartingInventory();\n154\t    }\n155\t\n156\t    // Setup day cycle event listeners\n157\t    this.dayCycle.onPhaseChange((phase, prev) => {\n158\t      this.state.phase = phase;\n159\t      this.onStateChange?.(this.state);\n160\t    });\n161\t\n162\t    this.dayCycle.onNewDay((day) => {\n163\t      this.onNewDay();\n164\t    });\n165\t\n166\t    // M4: Horror event callbacks\n167\t    this.horrorManager.onSanityChange = (delta) => {\n168\t      this.state.player.sanity = Math.max(0, Math.min(100, this.state.player.sanity + delta));\n169\t      this.state.fearLevel = Math.min(1, this.state.fearLevel + Math.abs(delta) / 100);\n170\t    };\n171\t    this.horrorManager.onNotification = (text) => {\n172\t      this.addNotification(text);\n173\t    };\n174\t    this.horrorManager.onEventTrigger = (event) => {\n175\t      this.state.horrorEventsTriggered++;\n176\t      this.state.lastHorrorEventDay = this.state.day;\n177\t      this.triggerHorrorAudio(event.type);\n178\t    };\n179\t\n180\t    // M5: Jump scare callbacks\n181\t    this.jumpScareManager.onSanityDrain = (amount) => {\n182\t      this.state.player.sanity = Math.max(0, this.state.player.sanity - amount);\n183\t      this.state.fearLevel = Math.min(1, this.state.fearLevel + amount / 100);\n184\t    };\n185\t    this.jumpScareManager.onMoneyLoss = (percent) => {\n186\t      const loss = this.state.dailyRevenue * percent;\n187\t      this.state.dailyRevenue = Math.max(0, this.state.dailyRevenue - loss);\n188\t      this.economy.addExpense(loss);\n189\t    };\n190\t    this.jumpScareManager.onNotification = (text) => {\n191\t      this.addNotification(text);\n192\t    };\n193\t    this.jumpScareManager.onScareTrigger = (scare) => {\n194\t      this.audioManager.playHorrorJumpScare();\n195\t      this.state.horrorEventsTriggered++;\n196\t    };\n197\t\n198\t    // M4: Phase change BGM switching\n199\t    this.dayCycle.onPhaseChange((phase) => {\n200\t      this.switchBgmForPhase(phase);\n201\t    });\n202\t\n203\t    // Snap camera to player immediately\n204\t    this.renderer.camera.snapTo(this.player.x + 16, this.player.y + 16);\n205\t\n206\t    // Setup keyboard shortcuts for panels\n207\t    this.setupPanelInput();\n208\t\n209\t    window.addEventListener('resize', () => {\n210\t      this.renderer.resize();\n211\t    });\n212\t  }\n213\t\n214\t  private setupStartingInventory(): void {\n215\t    this.productManager.addToInventory('water', 10, 1);\n216\t    this.productManager.addToInventory('cola', 8, 1);\n217\t    this.productManager.addToInventory('chips', 8, 1);\n218\t    this.productManager.addToInventory('biscuit', 6, 1);\n219\t    this.productManager.addToInventory('candy', 10, 1);\n220\t    this.productManager.addToInventory('bento_chicken', 4, 1);\n221\t    this.productManager.addToInventory('bento_veg', 4, 1);\n222\t    this.productManager.addToInventory('tissue', 5, 1);\n223\t    this.productManager.addToInventory('battery', 3, 1);\n224\t\n225\t    this.productManager.stockShelf('shelf_1', 'chips', 5);\n226\t    this.productManager.stockShelf('shelf_2', 'cola', 5);\n227\t    this.productManager.stockShelf('shelf_3', 'tissue', 5);\n228\t    this.productManager.stockShelf('fridge_1', 'water', 5);\n229\t    this.productManager.stockShelf('fridge_2', 'bento_chicken', 3);\n230\t  }\n231\t\n232\t  private applyUpgrades(): void {\n233\t    // M3 UpgradeManager effects\n234\t    this.renderer.lighting.setLightBoost(this.upgradeManager.getLightBoost());\n235\t\n236\t    if (this.upgradeManager.isPurchased('register_upgrade')) {\n237\t      this.registers.forEach(r => r.applySpeedUpgrade(0.3));\n238\t    }\n239\t    if (this.upgradeManager.isPurchased('warehouse_shelf')) {\n240\t      this.productManager.upgradeStorage(0.5);\n241\t    }\n242\t\n243\t    // Also apply economy system upgrades for backward compat\n244\t    if (this.economy.hasUpgrade('register_upgrade')) {\n245\t      this.registers.forEach(r => r.applySpeedUpgrade(0.3));\n246\t    }\n247\t    if (this.economy.hasUpgrade('warehouse_shelf')) {\n248\t      this.productManager.upgradeStorage(0.5);\n249\t    }\n250\t    if (this.economy.hasUpgrade('bright_lights')) {\n251\t      for (const light of this.state.lights) {\n252\t        light.intensity = Math.min(1, light.intensity * 1.5);\n253\t        light.radius *= 1.3;\n254\t      }\n255\t    }\n256\t  }\n257\t\n258\t  private setupPanelInput(): void {\n259\t    window.addEventListener('keydown', (e) => {\n260\t      // Dismiss day summary on any key\n261\t      if (this.daySummary.isVisible) {\n262\t        this.daySummary.dismiss();\n263\t        e.preventDefault();\n264\t        return;\n265\t      }\n266\t\n267\t      if (e.key === 'Escape') {\n268\t        if (this.state.activePanel !== UIPanel.NONE) {\n269\t          this.state.activePanel = UIPanel.NONE;\n270\t          this.shelfInteraction.close();\n271\t          e.preventDefault();\n272\t        }\n273\t      }\n274\t      if (e.key === 'i' || e.key === 'I') {\n275\t        this.togglePanel(UIPanel.INVENTORY);\n276\t        e.preventDefault();\n277\t      }\n278\t      if (e.key === 'p' || e.key === 'P') {\n279\t        this.togglePanel(UIPanel.PRICING);\n280\t        e.preventDefault();\n281\t      }\n282\t      if (e.key === 'u' || e.key === 'U') {\n283\t        this.togglePanel(UIPanel.SHOP);\n284\t        e.preventDefault();\n285\t      }\n286\t      if (e.key === 'o' || e.key === 'O') {\n287\t        this.togglePanel(UIPanel.SUPPLIER);\n288\t        e.preventDefault();\n289\t      }\n290\t    });\n291\t  }\n292\t\n293\t  private togglePanel(panel: UIPanel): void {\n294\t    this.state.activePanel = this.state.activePanel === panel ? UIPanel.NONE : panel;\n295\t    if (this.state.activePanel === UIPanel.NONE) {\n296\t      this.shelfInteraction.close();\n297\t    }\n298\t  }\n299\t\n300\t  private createInteractables(): Interactable[] {\n301\t    const S = TILE_SIZE;\n302\t    return [\n303\t      { id: 'register_1', type: 'register', x: 19 * S, y: 3 * S, width: S, height: S, label: '收银台', active: true },\n304\t      { id: 'register_2', type: 'register', x: 21 * S, y: 3 * S, width: S, height: S, label: '收银台', active: true },\n305\t      { id: 'shelf_1', type: 'shelf', x: 3 * S, y: 5 * S, width: 3 * S, height: S, label: '零食货架', active: true },\n306\t      { id: 'shelf_2', type: 'shelf', x: 7 * S, y: 5 * S, width: 3 * S, height: S, label: '饮料货架', active: true },\n307\t      { id: 'shelf_3', type: 'shelf', x: 11 * S, y: 5 * S, width: 3 * S, height: S, label: '日用品', active: true },\n308\t      { id: 'shelf_4', type: 'shelf', x: 17 * S, y: 5 * S, width: 3 * S, height: S, label: '烟酒柜', active: true },\n309\t      { id: 'shelf_5', type: 'shelf', x: 21 * S, y: 5 * S, width: 3 * S, height: S, label: '杂志架', active: true },\n310\t      { id: 'fridge_1', type: 'fridge', x: 3 * S, y: 9 * S, width: 3 * S, height: S, label: '冷饮冰柜', active: true },\n311\t      { id: 'fridge_2', type: 'fridge', x: 7 * S, y: 9 * S, width: 3 * S, height: S, label: '冷冻食品', active: true },\n312\t      { id: 'door_front', type: 'door', x: 14 * S, y: 0, width: 2 * S, height: S, label: '前门', active: true },\n313\t      { id: 'door_back', type: 'door', x: 9 * S, y: 24 * S, width: 2 * S, height: S, label: '后门', active: true },\n314\t      { id: 'door_warehouse', type: 'door', x: 14 * S, y: 11 * S, width: 2 * S, height: S, label: '仓库门', active: true },\n315\t      { id: 'note_safe', type: 'note', x: 4 * S, y: 20 * S, width: S, height: S, label: '保险柜', active: true },\n316\t    ];\n317\t  }\n318\t\n319\t  private createLights(): LightSource[] {\n320\t    const S = TILE_SIZE;\n321\t    return [\n322\t      { x: 15 * S, y: 3 * S, radius: 200, color: '#fff5e0', intensity: 0.8, flicker: false, flickerSpeed: 0 },\n323\t      { x: 8 * S, y: 6 * S, radius: 150, color: '#fff5e0', intensity: 0.7, flicker: false, flickerSpeed: 0 },\n324\t      { x: 22 * S, y: 6 * S, radius: 150, color: '#fff5e0', intensity: 0.7, flicker: false, flickerSpeed: 0 },\n325\t      { x: 8 * S, y: 8 * S, radius: 150, color: '#fff5e0', intensity: 0.7, flicker: false, flickerSpeed: 0 },\n326\t      { x: 15 * S, y: 10 * S, radius: 150, color: '#fff5e0', intensity: 0.6, flicker: false, flickerSpeed: 0 },\n327\t      { x: 12 * S, y: 14 * S, radius: 120, color: '#e0d0b0', intensity: 0.5, flicker: true, flickerSpeed: 3.5 },\n328\t      { x: 22 * S, y: 20 * S, radius: 100, color: '#ffe8c0', intensity: 0.4, flicker: false, flickerSpeed: 0 },\n329\t      { x: 20 * S, y: 3 * S, radius: 80, color: '#ffffff', intensity: 0.6, flicker: false, flickerSpeed: 0 },\n330\t    ];\n331\t  }\n332\t\n333\t  start(): void {\n334\t    if (this.running) return;\n335\t    this.running = true;\n336\t    this.lastFrameTime = performance.now();\n337\t    this.loop(this.lastFrameTime);\n338\t    startAutoSave(\n339\t      () => this.state,\n340\t      () => ({\n341\t        pm: this.productManager.getSaveData(),\n342\t        eco: this.economy.getSaveData(),\n343\t        prc: this.pricing.getSaveData(),\n344\t        cust: this.customerManager.getSaveData(),\n345\t        regs: this.registers.map(r => r.getSaveData()),\n346\t      }),\n347\t    );\n348\t    this.saveManager.startAutoSave(() => this.state);\n349\t  }\n350\t\n351\t  stop(): void {\n352\t    this.running = false;\n353\t    if (this.animFrameId) cancelAnimationFrame(this.animFrameId);\n354\t    stopAutoSave();\n355\t    this.saveManager.save(this.state);\n356\t  }\n357\t\n358\t  private loop = (now: number): void => {\n359\t    if (!this.running) return;\n360\t\n361\t    const dt = Math.min(now - this.lastFrameTime, 50);\n362\t    this.lastFrameTime = now;\n363\t\n364\t    this.state.totalPlaytime += dt / 1000;\n365\t\n366\t    // M3: Use DayCycle for time management\n367\t    const prevDay = this.state.day;\n368\t    this.dayCycle.update(dt);\n369\t    this.state.day = this.dayCycle.currentDay;\n370\t    this.state.timeOfDay = this.dayCycle.currentTime;\n371\t    this.state.phase = this.dayCycle.currentPhase;\n372\t    this.state.player.day = this.state.day;\n373\t\n374\t    // Update player (skip if panel is open)\n375\t    if (this.state.activePanel === UIPanel.NONE) {\n376\t      this.player.update(dt, this.map);\n377\t    }\n378\t\n379\t    // Handle interaction\n380\t    if (this.player.consumeInteract()) {\n381\t      this.handleInteraction();\n382\t    }\n383\t\n384\t    // Update M2 systems\n385\t    this.updateManagementSystems(dt, now);\n386\t\n387\t    // Update M3 day summary\n388\t    this.daySummary.update(dt);\n389\t\n390\t    // M4: Update horror events\n391\t    const horrorVisuals = this.horrorManager.update(dt, this.state.day, this.state.phase, this.state.timeOfDay, this.state.player.sanity);\n392\t\n393\t    // M5: Update NPCs and jump scares\n394\t    this.npcManager.update(dt, this.state.day, this.state.timeOfDay, this.player.x, this.player.y, this.state.player.sanity, this.state.fearLevel);\n395\t    const scareVisuals = this.jumpScareManager.update(dt, this.state.day, this.state.phase, this.state.player.sanity);\n396\t\n397\t    // Update camera\n398\t    this.renderer.camera.follow(this.player.x + 16, this.player.y + 16);\n399\t\n400\t    // Update shelf interaction messages\n401\t    this.shelfInteraction.update(dt);\n402\t\n403\t    // Render\n404\t    this.renderer.render(this.map, this.player, this.state, now, {\n405\t      customers: this.activeCustomers,\n406\t      productManager: this.productManager,\n407\t      shelfInteraction: this.shelfInteraction,\n408\t      registers: this.registers,\n409\t      economy: this.economy,\n410\t      pricing: this.pricing,\n411\t      lastTransaction: this.lastTransactionNotification,\n412\t      daySummary: this.daySummary,\n413\t      upgradeManager: this.upgradeManager,\n414\t      horrorVisuals: horrorVisuals,\n415\t      scareVisuals: scareVisuals,\n416\t      activeNPCs: this.npcManager.getActiveNPCs(),\n417\t    });\n418\t\n419\t    this.animFrameId = requestAnimationFrame(this.loop);\n420\t  };\n421\t\n422\t  private updateManagementSystems(dt: number, now: number): void {\n423\t    // Process pending orders\n424\t    const fulfilled = this.productManager.processPendingOrders(this.state.day);\n425\t    if (fulfilled.length > 0) {\n426\t      for (const order of fulfilled) {\n427\t        const product = this.productManager.getProduct(order.productId);\n428\t        this.addNotification(`到货: ${product?.name ?? order.productId} x${order.quantity}`);\n429\t      }\n430\t    }\n431\t\n432\t    // Expire products\n433\t    const expired = this.productManager.expireProducts(this.state.day);\n434\t    if (expired.length > 0) {\n435\t      for (const pid of expired) {\n436\t        const product = this.productManager.getProduct(pid);\n437\t        this.addNotification(`过期: ${product?.name ?? pid}`);\n438\t      }\n439\t    }\n440\t\n441\t    // Update customers\n442\t    this.activeCustomers = this.customerManager.update(dt, this.state.timeOfDay, this.state.day, this.productManager);\n443\t\n444\t    // Update demand\n445\t    this.pricing.updateDemand(this.state.timeOfDay);\n446\t\n447\t    // Update registers\n448\t    for (const register of this.registers) {\n449\t      const txn = register.update(dt);\n450\t      if (txn) {\n451\t        this.economy.addRevenue(txn.total);\n452\t        this.state.dailyRevenue += txn.total;\n453\t        this.lastTransactionNotification = `交易完成: ¥${txn.total.toFixed(2)}`;\n454\t        this.addNotification(this.lastTransactionNotification);\n455\t\n456\t        if (txn.isAnomalous) {\n457\t          this.addNotification('⚠ 收银机出现异常...');\n458\t          this.state.player.sanity = Math.max(0, this.state.player.sanity - 5);\n459\t        }\n460\t\n461\t        for (const item of txn.items) {\n462\t          this.pricing.recordSale(item.productId);\n463\t        }\n464\t      }\n465\t\n466\t      if (register.canAcceptCustomer()) {\n467\t        const waiting = this.customerManager.getFirstWaiting();\n468\t        if (waiting) {\n469\t          register.startCheckout(waiting, this.productManager, this.pricing);\n470\t        }\n471\t      }\n472\t    }\n473\t\n474\t    // Sync economy money with game state\n475\t    this.state.money = this.economy.getMoney();\n476\t    this.state.debt = this.economy.debt;\n477\t  }\n478\t\n479\t  private handleInteraction(): void {\n480\t    if (this.state.activePanel !== UIPanel.NONE) {\n481\t      this.state.activePanel = UIPanel.NONE;\n482\t      this.shelfInteraction.close();\n483\t      return;\n484\t    }\n485\t\n486\t    const facing = this.player.getFacingTile();\n487\t\n488\t    const obj = this.state.interactables.find(o => {\n489\t      const oGX = Math.floor(o.x / TILE_SIZE);\n490\t      const oGY = Math.floor(o.y / TILE_SIZE);\n491\t      const oGW = Math.ceil(o.width / TILE_SIZE);\n492\t      const oGH = Math.ceil(o.height / TILE_SIZE);\n493\t      return facing.gx >= oGX && facing.gx < oGX + oGW && facing.gy >= oGY && facing.gy < oGY + oGH;\n494\t    });\n495\t\n496\t    if (!obj) return;\n497\t\n498\t    switch (obj.type) {\n499\t      case 'shelf':\n500\t      case 'fridge': {\n501\t        const info = this.shelfInteraction.interactWithShelf(obj.id, this.state.interactables, this.productManager);\n502\t        if (info) {\n503\t          this.state.activePanel = UIPanel.SHELF;\n504\t          this.onNotification?.(`货架: ${info.label} — ${info.productName ?? '空'} (${info.quantity}/${info.maxQuantity})`);\n505\t        }\n506\t        break;\n507\t      }\n508\t      case 'register': {\n509\t        const register = this.registers.find(r => r.registerId === obj.id);\n510\t        const waiting = this.customerManager.getFirstWaiting();\n511\t        if (register && register.canAcceptCustomer() && waiting) {\n512\t          register.startCheckout(waiting, this.productManager, this.pricing);\n513\t          this.onNotification?.('开始收银...');\n514\t        } else if (register && !register.canAcceptCustomer()) {\n515\t          this.onNotification?.('收银中...');\n516\t        } else {\n517\t          this.onNotification?.('收银台 — 没有顾客等待');\n518\t        }\n519\t        break;\n520\t      }\n521\t      case 'door':\n522\t        this.onNotification?.(`交互: ${obj.label}`);\n523\t        break;\n524\t      default:\n525\t        this.onNotification?.(`交互: ${obj.label}`);\n526\t    }\n527\t  }\n528\t\n529\t  private onNewDay(): void {\n530\t    const report = this.economy.endDay();\n531\t\n532\t    // M4: Reset horror system for new day\n533\t    this.horrorManager.resetDaily();\n534\t    this.state.fearLevel = Math.max(0, this.state.fearLevel - 0.3);\n535\t\n536\t    // M5: Reset NPC and jump scare systems\n537\t    this.npcManager.resetDaily();\n538\t    this.jumpScareManager.resetDaily();\n539\t\n540\t    // M3: Generate day summary with display\n541\t    this.daySummary.generateSummary(report, this.customerManager);\n542\t\n543\t    // Create day summary record\n544\t    const stats = this.customerManager.getStats();\n545\t    this.state.daySummaries.push({\n546\t      day: report.day,\n547\t      revenue: report.revenue,\n548\t      expenses: report.expenses,\n549\t      customersServed: stats.served,\n550\t      customersLost: stats.lost,\n551\t      debtRemaining: report.debtRemaining,\n552\t    });\n553\t\n554\t    this.state.dailyRevenue = 0;\n555\t    this.state.dailyExpenses = 0;\n556\t    this.customerManager.resetDailyStats();\n557\t    this.pricing.resetDailyVelocity();\n558\t\n559\t    this.addNotification(`Day ${report.day} 结算: 收入¥${report.revenue} 支出¥${report.expenses} 债务¥${report.debtRemaining}`);\n560\t\n561\t    // M3: Auto-save after day end\n562\t    this.saveManager.save(this.state);\n563\t\n564\t    // Check game over\n565\t    const gameOver = this.economy.isGameOver();\n566\t    if (gameOver.over) {\n567\t      this.addNotification(`游戏结束: ${gameOver.reason}`);\n568\t    }\n569\t  }\n570\t\n571\t  private addNotification(text: string): void {\n572\t    this.state.notifications.push(text);\n573\t    if (this.state.notifications.length > 10) {\n574\t      this.state.notifications.shift();\n575\t    }\n576\t    this.onNotification?.(text);\n577\t  }\n578\t\n579\t  // Public API for UI interaction\n580\t  stockShelf(shelfId: string, productId: string, quantity: number): void {\n581\t    this.shelfInteraction.stockShelf(shelfId, productId, quantity, this.productManager);\n582\t  }\n583\t\n584\t  unstockShelf(shelfId: string, quantity: number): void {\n585\t    this.shelfInteraction.unstockShelf(shelfId, quantity, this.productManager);\n586\t  }\n587\t\n588\t  orderProduct(productId: string, quantity: number, supplierId: string): boolean {\n589\t    const order = this.productManager.orderProduct(productId, quantity, supplierId, this.state.day);\n590\t    if (order) {\n591\t      this.economy.addPurchaseCost(order.totalCost);\n592\t      this.state.money = this.economy.getMoney();\n593\t      const product = this.productManager.getProduct(productId);\n594\t      this.addNotification(`下单: ${product?.name} x${quantity} — ¥${order.totalCost}`);\n595\t      return true;\n596\t    }\n597\t    return false;\n598\t  }\n599\t\n600\t  purchaseUpgrade(upgradeId: string): { success: boolean; message: string } {\n601\t    const result = this.economy.purchaseUpgrade(upgradeId);\n602\t    if (result.success) {\n603\t      this.state.money = this.economy.getMoney();\n604\t      this.applyUpgrades();\n605\t      this.addNotification(result.message);\n606\t    }\n607\t    return result;\n608\t  }\n609\t\n610\t  purchaseUpgradeM3(upgradeId: string): { success: boolean; message: string } {\n611\t    const result = this.upgradeManager.purchase(upgradeId, this.state.money);\n612\t    if (result.success) {\n613\t      this.economy.addExpense(result.cost);\n614\t      this.state.money = this.economy.getMoney();\n615\t      this.applyUpgrades();\n616\t      this.addNotification(result.message);\n617\t    }\n618\t    return { success: result.success, message: result.message };\n619\t  }\n620\t\n621\t  setProductPrice(productId: string, price: number): boolean {\n622\t    return this.pricing.setPrice(productId, price);\n623\t  }\n624\t\n625\t  centerCamera(): void {\n626\t    this.renderer.camera.snapTo(this.player.x + 16, this.player.y + 16);\n627\t  }\n628\t\n629\t  setTimeSpeed(speed: number): void {\n630\t    this.state.timeSpeed = speed;\n631\t  }\n632\t\n633\t  // M4: Horror audio helpers\n634\t  private triggerHorrorAudio(type: HorrorEventType): void {\n635\t    switch (type) {\n636\t      case HorrorEventType.LIGHT_FLICKER:\n637\t        this.audioManager.playHorrorFlicker();\n638\t        break;\n639\t      case HorrorEventType.FRIDGE_NOISE:\n640\t        this.audioManager.playHorrorJumpScare();\n641\t        break;\n642\t      case HorrorEventType.WHISPER:\n643\t        this.audioManager.playHorrorWhisper();\n644\t        break;\n645\t      case HorrorEventType.DOOR_AUTO_OPEN:\n646\t        this.audioManager.playHorrorDoorCreak();\n647\t        break;\n648\t      case HorrorEventType.GHOST_CUSTOMER:\n649\t      case HorrorEventType.DUPLICATE_CUSTOMER:\n650\t      case HorrorEventType.NONPAYING_CUSTOMER:\n651\t        this.audioManager.playHorrorAmbientDrone();\n652\t        break;\n653\t      case HorrorEventType.STORE_MUTATE:\n654\t      case HorrorEventType.TIME_GLITCH:\n655\t      case HorrorEventType.MIRROR_STORE:\n656\t      case HorrorEventType.HE_COMES:\n657\t      case HorrorEventType.FINAL_CHOICE:\n658\t        this.audioManager.playHorrorJumpScare();\n659\t        break;\n660\t      case HorrorEventType.STALKER:\n661\t      case HorrorEventType.CCTV_DOUBLE:\n662\t      case HorrorEventType.CORRIDOR_EXTEND:\n663\t        this.audioManager.playHorrorAmbientDrone();\n664\t        break;\n665\t      case HorrorEventType.RADIO_VOICE:\n666\t        this.audioManager.playHorrorWhisper();\n667\t        break;\n668\t      default:\n669\t        this.audioManager.playHorrorAmbientDrone();\n670\t        break;\n671\t    }\n672\t  }\n673\t\n674\t  private switchBgmForPhase(phase: GamePhase): void {\n675\t    if (phase === GamePhase.DAYTIME) {\n676\t      this.audioManager.playBgm('daytime');\n677\t    } else if (phase === GamePhase.NIGHT || phase === GamePhase.NIGHT_TRANSITION) {\n678\t      this.audioManager.playBgm('night');\n679\t    } else if (phase === GamePhase.DANGER) {\n680\t      this.audioManager.playBgm('danger');\n681\t    } else {\n682\t      this.audioManager.stopBgm();\n683\t    }\n684\t  }\n685\t}\n686\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d0384c8e-0462-4f8e-9470-2647774e089a","uuid":"3c665505-33a1-48b4-b21b-903a396da8c1","timestamp":"2026-05-23T05:12:29.849Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"D:\\game-projects\\steam-horror-sim\\src\\renderer\\App.ts","content":"// App.ts — Game main loop + state machine (v0.4.0 — M4: Horror Events)\n\nimport { Renderer } from './Renderer';\nimport { StoreMap, TILE_SIZE, T } from '../game/StoreMap';\nimport { Player } from '../game/Player';\nimport {\n  type GameState,\n  type Interactable,\n  type LightSource,\n  GamePhase,\n  UIPanel,\n  createInitialState,\n  loadGame,\n  saveGame,\n  startAutoSave,\n  stopAutoSave,\n  getPhaseFromTime,\n  cloneState,\n  isNightTime,\n} from '../game/GameState';\nimport { ProductManager } from '../game/ProductManager';\nimport { CustomerManager } from '../game/CustomerManager';\nimport { CashRegister } from '../game/CashRegister';\nimport { PricingSystem } from '../game/PricingSystem';\nimport { EconomySystem } from '../game/EconomySystem';\nimport { ShelfInteraction, ShelfAction } from '../game/ShelfInteraction';\nimport { Customer, CustomerState } from '../game/Customer';\nimport { DayCycle } from '../game/DayCycle';\nimport { DaySummaryManager } from '../game/DaySummary';\nimport { UpgradeManager } from '../game/UpgradeManager';\nimport { SaveManager } from '../game/SaveManager';\nimport { HorrorEventManager, HorrorEventType } from '../game/HorrorEventManager';\nimport { AudioManager } from '../game/AudioManager';\nimport { NPCManager } from '../game/BehaviorTree';\nimport { JumpScareManager } from '../game/JumpScareManager';\n\nexport class App {\n  canvas: HTMLCanvasElement;\n  renderer: Renderer;\n  state: GameState;\n  map: StoreMap;\n  player: Player;\n\n  // M2 systems\n  productManager: ProductManager;\n  customerManager: CustomerManager;\n  registers: CashRegister[];\n  pricing: PricingSystem;\n  economy: EconomySystem;\n  shelfInteraction: ShelfInteraction;\n\n  // M3 systems\n  dayCycle: DayCycle;\n  daySummary: DaySummaryManager;\n  upgradeManager: UpgradeManager;\n  saveManager: SaveManager;\n\n  // M4 systems\n  horrorManager: HorrorEventManager;\n  audioManager: AudioManager;\n\n  // M5 systems\n  npcManager: NPCManager;\n  jumpScareManager: JumpScareManager;\n\n  private running = false;\n  private lastFrameTime = 0;\n  private animFrameId = 0;\n  private activeCustomers: Customer[] = [];\n  private lastTransactionNotification = '';\n\n  onStateChange?: (state: GameState) => void;\n  onNotification?: (text: string) => void;\n\n  constructor(canvas: HTMLCanvasElement) {\n    this.canvas = canvas;\n    this.renderer = new Renderer(canvas);\n\n    const saved = loadGame();\n    this.state = saved ? { ...createInitialState(), ...saved.gameState } : createInitialState();\n\n    this.map = new StoreMap();\n    this.player = new Player(this.state.player);\n    this.player.setupInput();\n\n    // Initialize M2 systems\n    this.productManager = new ProductManager();\n    this.customerManager = new CustomerManager();\n    this.registers = [\n      new CashRegister('register_1'),\n      new CashRegister('register_2'),\n    ];\n    this.pricing = new PricingSystem(this.productManager);\n    this.economy = new EconomySystem();\n    this.shelfInteraction = new ShelfInteraction();\n\n    // Initialize M3 systems\n    this.dayCycle = new DayCycle();\n    this.daySummary = new DaySummaryManager();\n    this.upgradeManager = new UpgradeManager();\n    this.saveManager = new SaveManager();\n\n    // Initialize M4 systems\n    this.horrorManager = new HorrorEventManager();\n    this.audioManager = new AudioManager();\n\n    // Initialize M5 systems\n    this.npcManager = new NPCManager();\n    this.jumpScareManager = new JumpScareManager();\n\n    // Register systems with SaveManager\n    this.saveManager.register('productManager', this.productManager);\n    this.saveManager.register('economy', this.economy);\n    this.saveManager.register('pricing', this.pricing);\n    this.saveManager.register('customerManager', this.customerManager);\n    this.saveManager.register('upgradeManager', this.upgradeManager);\n    this.saveManager.register('daySummary', this.daySummary);\n\n    // Load save data for M2 systems\n    if (saved) {\n      if (saved.productManager && Object.keys(saved.productManager).length > 0) {\n        this.productManager.loadSaveData(saved.productManager);\n      }\n      if (saved.economy && Object.keys(saved.economy).length > 0) {\n        this.economy.loadSaveData(saved.economy);\n      }\n      if (saved.pricing && Object.keys(saved.pricing).length > 0) {\n        this.pricing.loadSaveData(saved.pricing);\n      }\n      if (saved.customerStats && Object.keys(saved.customerStats).length > 0) {\n        this.customerManager.loadSaveData(saved.customerStats);\n      }\n      if (saved.registers) {\n        for (let i = 0; i < saved.registers.length && i < this.registers.length; i++) {\n          this.registers[i].loadSaveData(saved.registers[i]);\n        }\n      }\n\n      // Restore M3 day cycle state\n      this.dayCycle.setDay(this.state.day);\n      this.dayCycle.setTimeOfDay(this.state.timeOfDay);\n    }\n\n    // Apply purchased upgrades\n    this.applyUpgrades();\n\n    // Setup interactable objects\n    this.state.interactables = this.createInteractables();\n    this.state.lights = this.createLights();\n\n    // Give some starting inventory\n    if (!saved) {\n      this.setupStartingInventory();\n    }\n\n    // Setup day cycle event listeners\n    this.dayCycle.onPhaseChange((phase, prev) => {\n      this.state.phase = phase;\n      this.onStateChange?.(this.state);\n    });\n\n    this.dayCycle.onNewDay((day) => {\n      this.onNewDay();\n    });\n\n    // M4: Horror event callbacks\n    this.horrorManager.onSanityChange = (delta) => {\n      this.state.player.sanity = Math.max(0, Math.min(100, this.state.player.sanity + delta));\n      this.state.fearLevel = Math.min(1, this.state.fearLevel + Math.abs(delta) / 100);\n    };\n    this.horrorManager.onNotification = (text) => {\n      this.addNotification(text);\n    };\n    this.horrorManager.onEventTrigger = (event) => {\n      this.state.horrorEventsTriggered++;\n      this.state.lastHorrorEventDay = this.state.day;\n      this.triggerHorrorAudio(event.type);\n    };\n\n    // M5: Jump scare callbacks\n    this.jumpScareManager.onSanityDrain = (amount) => {\n      this.state.player.sanity = Math.max(0, this.state.player.sanity - amount);\n      this.state.fearLevel = Math.min(1, this.state.fearLevel + amount / 100);\n    };\n    this.jumpScareManager.onMoneyLoss = (percent) => {\n      const loss = this.state.dailyRevenue * percent;\n      this.state.dailyRevenue = Math.max(0, this.state.dailyRevenue - loss);\n      this.economy.addExpense(loss);\n    };\n    this.jumpScareManager.onNotification = (text) => {\n      this.addNotification(text);\n    };\n    this.jumpScareManager.onScareTrigger = (scare) => {\n      this.audioManager.playHorrorJumpScare();\n      this.state.horrorEventsTriggered++;\n    };\n\n    // M4: Phase change BGM switching\n    this.dayCycle.onPhaseChange((phase) => {\n      this.switchBgmForPhase(phase);\n    });\n\n    // Snap camera to player immediately\n    this.renderer.camera.snapTo(this.player.x + 16, this.player.y + 16);\n\n    // Setup keyboard shortcuts for panels\n    this.setupPanelInput();\n\n    window.addEventListener('resize', () => {\n      this.renderer.resize();\n    });\n  }\n\n  private setupStartingInventory(): void {\n    this.productManager.addToInventory('water', 10, 1);\n    this.productManager.addToInventory('cola', 8, 1);\n    this.productManager.addToInventory('chips', 8, 1);\n    this.productManager.addToInventory('biscuit', 6, 1);\n    this.productManager.addToInventory('candy', 10, 1);\n    this.productManager.addToInventory('bento_chicken', 4, 1);\n    this.productManager.addToInventory('bento_veg', 4, 1);\n    this.productManager.addToInventory('tissue', 5, 1);\n    this.productManager.addToInventory('battery', 3, 1);\n\n    this.productManager.stockShelf('shelf_1', 'chips', 5);\n    this.productManager.stockShelf('shelf_2', 'cola', 5);\n    this.productManager.stockShelf('shelf_3', 'tissue', 5);\n    this.productManager.stockShelf('fridge_1', 'water', 5);\n    this.productManager.stockShelf('fridge_2', 'bento_chicken', 3);\n  }\n\n  private applyUpgrades(): void {\n    // M3 UpgradeManager effects\n    this.renderer.lighting.setLightBoost(this.upgradeManager.getLightBoost());\n\n    if (this.upgradeManager.isPurchased('register_upgrade')) {\n      this.registers.forEach(r => r.applySpeedUpgrade(0.3));\n    }\n    if (this.upgradeManager.isPurchased('warehouse_shelf')) {\n      this.productManager.upgradeStorage(0.5);\n    }\n\n    // Also apply economy system upgrades for backward compat\n    if (this.economy.hasUpgrade('register_upgrade')) {\n      this.registers.forEach(r => r.applySpeedUpgrade(0.3));\n    }\n    if (this.economy.hasUpgrade('warehouse_shelf')) {\n      this.productManager.upgradeStorage(0.5);\n    }\n    if (this.economy.hasUpgrade('bright_lights')) {\n      for (const light of this.state.lights) {\n        light.intensity = Math.min(1, light.intensity * 1.5);\n        light.radius *= 1.3;\n      }\n    }\n  }\n\n  private setupPanelInput(): void {\n    window.addEventListener('keydown', (e) => {\n      // Dismiss day summary on any key\n      if (this.daySummary.isVisible) {\n        this.daySummary.dismiss();\n        e.preventDefault();\n        return;\n      }\n\n      if (e.key === 'Escape') {\n        if (this.state.activePanel !== UIPanel.NONE) {\n          this.state.activePanel = UIPanel.NONE;\n          this.shelfInteraction.close();\n          e.preventDefault();\n        }\n      }\n      if (e.key === 'i' || e.key === 'I') {\n        this.togglePanel(UIPanel.INVENTORY);\n        e.preventDefault();\n      }\n      if (e.key === 'p' || e.key === 'P') {\n        this.togglePanel(UIPanel.PRICING);\n        e.preventDefault();\n      }\n      if (e.key === 'u' || e.key === 'U') {\n        this.togglePanel(UIPanel.SHOP);\n        e.preventDefault();\n      }\n      if (e.key === 'o' || e.key === 'O') {\n        this.togglePanel(UIPanel.SUPPLIER);\n        e.preventDefault();\n      }\n    });\n  }\n\n  private togglePanel(panel: UIPanel): void {\n    this.state.activePanel = this.state.activePanel === panel ? UIPanel.NONE : panel;\n    if (this.state.activePanel === UIPanel.NONE) {\n      this.shelfInteraction.close();\n    }\n  }\n\n  private createInteractables(): Interactable[] {\n    const S = TILE_SIZE;\n    return [\n      { id: 'register_1', type: 'register', x: 19 * S, y: 3 * S, width: S, height: S, label: '收银台', active: true },\n      { id: 'register_2', type: 'register', x: 21 * S, y: 3 * S, width: S, height: S, label: '收银台', active: true },\n      { id: 'shelf_1', type: 'shelf', x: 3 * S, y: 5 * S, width: 3 * S, height: S, label: '零食货架', active: true },\n      { id: 'shelf_2', type: 'shelf', x: 7 * S, y: 5 * S, width: 3 * S, height: S, label: '饮料货架', active: true },\n      { id: 'shelf_3', type: 'shelf', x: 11 * S, y: 5 * S, width: 3 * S, height: S, label: '日用品', active: true },\n      { id: 'shelf_4', type: 'shelf', x: 17 * S, y: 5 * S, width: 3 * S, height: S, label: '烟酒柜', active: true },\n      { id: 'shelf_5', type: 'shelf', x: 21 * S, y: 5 * S, width: 3 * S, height: S, label: '杂志架', active: true },\n      { id: 'fridge_1', type: 'fridge', x: 3 * S, y: 9 * S, width: 3 * S, height: S, label: '冷饮冰柜', active: true },\n      { id: 'fridge_2', type: 'fridge', x: 7 * S, y: 9 * S, width: 3 * S, height: S, label: '冷冻食品', active: true },\n      { id: 'door_front', type: 'door', x: 14 * S, y: 0, width: 2 * S, height: S, label: '前门', active: true },\n      { id: 'door_back', type: 'door', x: 9 * S, y: 24 * S, width: 2 * S, height: S, label: '后门', active: true },\n      { id: 'door_warehouse', type: 'door', x: 14 * S, y: 11 * S, width: 2 * S, height: S, label: '仓库门', active: true },\n      { id: 'note_safe', type: 'note', x: 4 * S, y: 20 * S, width: S, height: S, label: '保险柜', active: true },\n    ];\n  }\n\n  private createLights(): LightSource[] {\n    const S = TILE_SIZE;\n    return [\n      { x: 15 * S, y: 3 * S, radius: 200, color: '#fff5e0', intensity: 0.8, flicker: false, flickerSpeed: 0 },\n      { x: 8 * S, y: 6 * S, radius: 150, color: '#fff5e0', intensity: 0.7, flicker: false, flickerSpeed: 0 },\n      { x: 22 * S, y: 6 * S, radius: 150, color: '#fff5e0', intensity: 0.7, flicker: false, flickerSpeed: 0 },\n      { x: 8 * S, y: 8 * S, radius: 150, color: '#fff5e0', intensity: 0.7, flicker: false, flickerSpeed: 0 },\n      { x: 15 * S, y: 10 * S, radius: 150, color: '#fff5e0', intensity: 0.6, flicker: false, flickerSpeed: 0 },\n      { x: 12 * S, y: 14 * S, radius: 120, color: '#e0d0b0', intensity: 0.5, flicker: true, flickerSpeed: 3.5 },\n      { x: 22 * S, y: 20 * S, radius: 100, color: '#ffe8c0', intensity: 0.4, flicker: false, flickerSpeed: 0 },\n      { x: 20 * S, y: 3 * S, radius: 80, color: '#ffffff', intensity: 0.6, flicker: false, flickerSpeed: 0 },\n    ];\n  }\n\n  start(): void {\n    if (this.running) return;\n    this.running = true;\n    this.lastFrameTime = performance.now();\n    this.loop(this.lastFrameTime);\n    startAutoSave(\n      () => this.state,\n      () => ({\n        pm: this.productManager.getSaveData(),\n        eco: this.economy.getSaveData(),\n        prc: this.pricing.getSaveData(),\n        cust: this.customerManager.getSaveData(),\n        regs: this.registers.map(r => r.getSaveData()),\n      }),\n    );\n    this.saveManager.startAutoSave(() => this.state);\n  }\n\n  stop(): void {\n    this.running = false;\n    if (this.animFrameId) cancelAnimationFrame(this.animFrameId);\n    stopAutoSave();\n    this.saveManager.save(this.state);\n  }\n\n  private loop = (now: number): void => {\n    if (!this.running) return;\n\n    const dt = Math.min(now - this.lastFrameTime, 50);\n    this.lastFrameTime = now;\n\n    this.state.totalPlaytime += dt / 1000;\n\n    // M3: Use DayCycle for time management\n    const prevDay = this.state.day;\n    this.dayCycle.update(dt);\n    this.state.day = this.dayCycle.currentDay;\n    this.state.timeOfDay = this.dayCycle.currentTime;\n    this.state.phase = this.dayCycle.currentPhase;\n    this.state.player.day = this.state.day;\n\n    // Update player (skip if panel is open)\n    if (this.state.activePanel === UIPanel.NONE) {\n      this.player.update(dt, this.map);\n    }\n\n    // Handle interaction\n    if (this.player.consumeInteract()) {\n      this.handleInteraction();\n    }\n\n    // Update M2 systems\n    this.updateManagementSystems(dt, now);\n\n    // Update M3 day summary\n    this.daySummary.update(dt);\n\n    // M4: Update horror events\n    const horrorVisuals = this.horrorManager.update(dt, this.state.day, this.state.phase, this.state.timeOfDay, this.state.player.sanity);\n\n    // M5: Update NPCs and jump scares\n    this.npcManager.update(dt, this.state.day, this.state.timeOfDay, this.player.x, this.player.y, this.state.player.sanity, this.state.fearLevel);\n    const scareVisuals = this.jumpScareManager.update(dt, this.state.day, this.state.phase, this.state.player.sanity);\n\n    // Update camera\n    this.renderer.camera.follow(this.player.x + 16, this.player.y + 16);\n\n    // Update shelf interaction messages\n    this.shelfInteraction.update(dt);\n\n    // Render\n    this.renderer.render(this.map, this.player, this.state, now, {\n      customers: this.activeCustomers,\n      productManager: this.productManager,\n      shelfInteraction: this.shelfInteraction,\n      registers: this.registers,\n      economy: this.economy,\n      pricing: this.pricing,\n      lastTransaction: this.lastTransactionNotification,\n      daySummary: this.daySummary,\n      upgradeManager: this.upgradeManager,\n      horrorVisuals: horrorVisuals,\n      scareVisuals: scareVisuals,\n      activeNPCs: this.npcManager.getActiveNPCs(),\n    });\n\n    this.animFrameId = requestAnimationFrame(this.loop);\n  };\n\n  private updateManagementSystems(dt: number, now: number): void {\n    // Process pending orders\n    const fulfilled = this.productManager.processPendingOrders(this.state.day);\n    if (fulfilled.length > 0) {\n      for (const order of fulfilled) {\n        const product = this.productManager.getProduct(order.productId);\n        this.addNotification(`到货: ${product?.name ?? order.productId} x${order.quantity}`);\n      }\n    }\n\n    // Expire products\n    const expired = this.productManager.expireProducts(this.state.day);\n    if (expired.length > 0) {\n      for (const pid of expired) {\n        const product = this.productManager.getProduct(pid);\n        this.addNotification(`过期: ${product?.name ?? pid}`);\n      }\n    }\n\n    // Update customers\n    this.activeCustomers = this.customerManager.update(dt, this.state.timeOfDay, this.state.day, this.productManager);\n\n    // Update demand\n    this.pricing.updateDemand(this.state.timeOfDay);\n\n    // Update registers\n    for (const register of this.registers) {\n      const txn = register.update(dt);\n      if (txn) {\n        this.economy.addRevenue(txn.total);\n        this.state.dailyRevenue += txn.total;\n        this.lastTransactionNotification = `交易完成: ¥${txn.total.toFixed(2)}`;\n        this.addNotification(this.lastTransactionNotification);\n\n        if (txn.isAnomalous) {\n          this.addNotification('⚠ 收银机出现异常...');\n          this.state.player.sanity = Math.max(0, this.state.player.sanity - 5);\n        }\n\n        for (const item of txn.items) {\n          this.pricing.recordSale(item.productId);\n        }\n      }\n\n      if (register.canAcceptCustomer()) {\n        const waiting = this.customerManager.getFirstWaiting();\n        if (waiting) {\n          register.startCheckout(waiting, this.productManager, this.pricing);\n        }\n      }\n    }\n\n    // Sync economy money with game state\n    this.state.money = this.economy.getMoney();\n    this.state.debt = this.economy.debt;\n  }\n\n  private handleInteraction(): void {\n    if (this.state.activePanel !== UIPanel.NONE) {\n      this.state.activePanel = UIPanel.NONE;\n      this.shelfInteraction.close();\n      return;\n    }\n\n    const facing = this.player.getFacingTile();\n\n    const obj = this.state.interactables.find(o => {\n      const oGX = Math.floor(o.x / TILE_SIZE);\n      const oGY = Math.floor(o.y / TILE_SIZE);\n      const oGW = Math.ceil(o.width / TILE_SIZE);\n      const oGH = Math.ceil(o.height / TILE_SIZE);\n      return facing.gx >= oGX && facing.gx < oGX + oGW && facing.gy >= oGY && facing.gy < oGY + oGH;\n    });\n\n    if (!obj) return;\n\n    switch (obj.type) {\n      case 'shelf':\n      case 'fridge': {\n        const info = this.shelfInteraction.interactWithShelf(obj.id, this.state.interactables, this.productManager);\n        if (info) {\n          this.state.activePanel = UIPanel.SHELF;\n          this.onNotification?.(`货架: ${info.label} — ${info.productName ?? '空'} (${info.quantity}/${info.maxQuantity})`);\n        }\n        break;\n      }\n      case 'register': {\n        const register = this.registers.find(r => r.registerId === obj.id);\n        const waiting = this.customerManager.getFirstWaiting();\n        if (register && register.canAcceptCustomer() && waiting) {\n          register.startCheckout(waiting, this.productManager, this.pricing);\n          this.onNotification?.('开始收银...');\n        } else if (register && !register.canAcceptCustomer()) {\n          this.onNotification?.('收银中...');\n        } else {\n          this.onNotification?.('收银台 — 没有顾客等待');\n        }\n        break;\n      }\n      case 'door':\n        this.onNotification?.(`交互: ${obj.label}`);\n        break;\n      default:\n        this.onNotification?.(`交互: ${obj.label}`);\n    }\n  }\n\n  private onNewDay(): void {\n    const report = this.economy.endDay();\n\n    // M4: Reset horror system for new day\n    this.horrorManager.resetDaily();\n    this.state.fearLevel = Math.max(0, this.state.fearLevel - 0.3);\n\n    // M5: Reset NPC and jump scare systems\n    this.npcManager.resetDaily();\n    this.jumpScareManager.resetDaily();\n\n    // M3: Generate day summary with display\n    this.daySummary.generateSummary(report, this.customerManager);\n\n    // Create day summary record\n    const stats = this.customerManager.getStats();\n    this.state.daySummaries.push({\n      day: report.day,\n      revenue: report.revenue,\n      expenses: report.expenses,\n      customersServed: stats.served,\n      customersLost: stats.lost,\n      debtRemaining: report.debtRemaining,\n    });\n\n    this.state.dailyRevenue = 0;\n    this.state.dailyExpenses = 0;\n    this.customerManager.resetDailyStats();\n    this.pricing.resetDailyVelocity();\n\n    this.addNotification(`Day ${report.day} 结算: 收入¥${report.revenue} 支出¥${report.expenses} 债务¥${report.debtRemaining}`);\n\n    // M3: Auto-save after day end\n    this.saveManager.save(this.state);\n\n    // Check game over\n    const gameOver = this.economy.isGameOver();\n    if (gameOver.over) {\n      this.addNotification(`游戏结束: ${gameOver.reason}`);\n    }\n  }\n\n  private addNotification(text: string): void {\n    this.state.notifications.push(text);\n    if (this.state.notifications.length > 10) {\n      this.state.notifications.shift();\n    }\n    this.onNotification?.(text);\n  }\n\n  // Public API for UI interaction\n  stockShelf(shelfId: string, productId: string, quantity: number): void {\n    this.shelfInteraction.stockShelf(shelfId, productId, quantity, this.productManager);\n  }\n\n  unstockShelf(shelfId: string, quantity: number): void {\n    this.shelfInteraction.unstockShelf(shelfId, quantity, this.productManager);\n  }\n\n  orderProduct(productId: string, quantity: number, supplierId: string): boolean {\n    const order = this.productManager.orderProduct(productId, quantity, supplierId, this.state.day);\n    if (order) {\n      this.economy.addPurchaseCost(order.totalCost);\n      this.state.money = this.economy.getMoney();\n      const product = this.productManager.getProduct(productId);\n      this.addNotification(`下单: ${product?.name} x${quantity} — ¥${order.totalCost}`);\n      return true;\n    }\n    return false;\n  }\n\n  purchaseUpgrade(upgradeId: string): { success: boolean; message: string } {\n    const result = this.economy.purchaseUpgrade(upgradeId);\n    if (result.success) {\n      this.state.money = this.economy.getMoney();\n      this.applyUpgrades();\n      this.addNotification(result.message);\n    }\n    return result;\n  }\n\n  purchaseUpgradeM3(upgradeId: string): { success: boolean; message: string } {\n    const result = this.upgradeManager.purchase(upgradeId, this.state.money);\n    if (result.success) {\n      this.economy.addExpense(result.cost);\n      this.state.money = this.economy.getMoney();\n      this.applyUpgrades();\n      this.addNotification(result.message);\n    }\n    return { success: result.success, message: result.message };\n  }\n\n  setProductPrice(productId: string, price: number): boolean {\n    return this.pricing.setPrice(productId, price);\n  }\n\n  centerCamera(): void {\n    this.renderer.camera.snapTo(this.player.x + 16, this.player.y + 16);\n  }\n\n  setTimeSpeed(speed: number): void {\n    this.state.timeSpeed = speed;\n  }\n\n  // M4: Horror audio helpers\n  private triggerHorrorAudio(type: HorrorEventType): void {\n    switch (type) {\n      case HorrorEventType.LIGHT_FLICKER:\n        this.audioManager.playHorrorFlicker();\n        break;\n      case HorrorEventType.FRIDGE_NOISE:\n        this.audioManager.playHorrorJumpScare();\n        break;\n      case HorrorEventType.WHISPER:\n        this.audioManager.playHorrorWhisper();\n        break;\n      case HorrorEventType.DOOR_AUTO_OPEN:\n        this.audioManager.playHorrorDoorCreak();\n        break;\n      case HorrorEventType.GHOST_CUSTOMER:\n      case HorrorEventType.DUPLICATE_CUSTOMER:\n      case HorrorEventType.NONPAYING_CUSTOMER:\n        this.audioManager.playHorrorAmbientDrone();\n        break;\n      case HorrorEventType.STORE_MUTATE:\n      case HorrorEventType.TIME_GLITCH:\n      case HorrorEventType.MIRROR_STORE:\n      case HorrorEventType.HE_COMES:\n      case HorrorEventType.FINAL_CHOICE:\n        this.audioManager.playHorrorJumpScare();\n        break;\n      case HorrorEventType.STALKER:\n      case HorrorEventType.CCTV_DOUBLE:\n      case HorrorEventType.CORRIDOR_EXTEND:\n        this.audioManager.playHorrorAmbientDrone();\n        break;\n      case HorrorEventType.RADIO_VOICE:\n        this.audioManager.playHorrorWhisper();\n        break;\n      default:\n        this.audioManager.playHorrorAmbientDrone();\n        break;\n    }\n  }\n\n  private switchBgmForPhase(phase: GamePhase): void {\n    if (phase === GamePhase.DAYTIME) {\n      this.audioManager.playBgm('daytime');\n    } else if (phase === GamePhase.NIGHT || phase === GamePhase.NIGHT_TRANSITION) {\n      this.audioManager.playBgm('night');\n    } else if (phase === GamePhase.DANGER) {\n      this.audioManager.playBgm('danger');\n    } else {\n      this.audioManager.stopBgm();\n    }\n  }\n}\n","numLines":686,"startLine":1,"totalLines":686}}}
